{
  "openapi": "3.0.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Boss API V1",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Partner API for account opening, recharge, and cancellation operations.\n\n## Authentication\nThe authorization method adopts the OAuth 2.0 Client Credentials Grant type, with the specific process as follows:<br>\n<br>Step 1: Use the obtained clientId and clientSecret to form the header Authorization: Basic base64(clientId:clientSecret), and request the access_token in Authorization Bearer format through the standard /oauth2/token endpoint. The access_token expires in one day (86400 seconds).<br>\n<br>Step 2: When accessing specific business interfaces, carry the access_token in Authorization Bearer format to access successfully.\n\n## Key Features\n- Unified endpoint for account opening and recharge\n- Support for both INACTIVE and ACTIVE account cancellations\n- Two-way ID validation (platformEndUserId, partnerUserId)\n- Partner-generated password system with MD5 hashing\n\n## Terminology\n- **platformEndUserId**: Platform-generated user identifier. In the platform's App, this is displayed as \"UID\" for end user convenience.\n- **requestId**: Unique request ID, used as the global transaction ID for the entire registration process.The value must be unique for each request (recommended format: UUID, snowflake ID, or business-specific unique identifier)\n- **partnerUserId**: A unique user identifier assigned by the partner within their system, used to map the partner's user to the platform's platformEndUserId.\n- **initialPassword**: The initial password provided by the third-party system when opening a new account. It is typically transmitted in MD5 hashed format to ensure secure transmission. This password is used for the user's first login, after which the user is required to reset it to complete the account activation process.\n\n## Document Information\n- Version: 1.0\n- Date: 2025-11-16\n- Status: Draft\n",
    "contact": {
      "name": "API Support"
    },
    "license": {
      "name": "Proprietary"
    },
    "x-jentic-source-url": "https://api.swaggerhub.com/apis/organizationname-441/boss-api-recharge/1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://example-server.com",
      "description": "Production server"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "bearerAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Authentication",
      "description": "OAuth 2.0 token management"
    },
    {
      "name": "Account Management",
      "description": "Account opening, recharge, and cancellation operations"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/oauth2/token": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Authentication"
        ],
        "summary": "Get OAuth 2.0 access token",
        "description": "Obtain an access token using OAuth 2.0 Client Credentials Grant.\nThe token is valid for 86400 seconds (24 hours).\n",
        "operationId": "getAccessToken",
        "security": [
          {
            "basicAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/x-www-form-urlencoded": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "grant_type"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "grant_type": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "client_credentials"
                    ],
                    "description": "OAuth 2.0 grant type"
                  }
                }
              },
              "example": {
                "grant_type": "client_credentials"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successfully obtained access token",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TokenResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "access_token": "eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...",
                  "token_type": "Bearer",
                  "expires_in": 86400
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Authentication failed",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "missingCredentials": {
                    "value": {
                      "errCode": 1010001,
                      "message": "Missing credentials"
                    }
                  },
                  "authenticationFailed": {
                    "value": {
                      "errCode": 1010003,
                      "message": "Authentication failed"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/partner-api/boss/user/register-recharge/v1": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Account Management"
        ],
        "summary": "Account opening and recharge (unified endpoint)",
        "description": "Unified endpoint for both account opening and additional recharge operations.\n\n## Account Opening (without platformEndUserId)\n- Requires `initialPassword` parameter\n- Validates (partnerUserId) doesn't exist\n- Generates new `platformEndUserId`\n- Creates INACTIVE account\n- Applies recharge\n\n## Additional Recharge (with platformEndUserId)\n- Does NOT require `initialPassword`\n- Validates partnerUserId and platformEndUserId match\n- Applies recharge to existing account\n- Updates total validity period\n",
        "operationId": "registerRechargeAccount",
        "security": [
          {
            "bearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AccountRechargeRequest"
              },
              "examples": {
                "accountOpening": {
                  "summary": "Account Opening",
                  "description": "New account creation with initial recharge",
                  "value": {
                    "requestId": "12345671130000140002",
                    "partnerUserId": "user12345",
                    "initialPassword": "e10adc3949ba59abbe56e057f20f883e",
                    "rechargeCode": "0024043040077815"
                  }
                },
                "additionalRecharge": {
                  "summary": "Additional Recharge",
                  "description": "Recharge for existing account",
                  "value": {
                    "requestId": "12345671130000140002",
                    "partnerUserId": "user12345",
                    "platformEndUserId": "d0em8df8lpi79uph6t60",
                    "rechargeCode": "0024043040077816"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Operation successful",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AccountRechargeResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "accountOpening": {
                    "summary": "Account Opening Success",
                    "value": {
                      "errCode": 0,
                      "message": "Success",
                      "result": {
                        "platformEndUserId": "d0em8df8lpi79uph6t60",
                        "validityPeriod": 30,
                        "partnerUserId": "user12345"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "additionalRecharge": {
                    "summary": "Additional Recharge Success",
                    "value": {
                      "errCode": 0,
                      "message": "Success",
                      "result": {
                        "platformEndUserId": "d0em8df8lpi79uph6t60",
                        "validityPeriod": 60,
                        "partnerUserId": "user12345"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Bad request - Invalid parameters",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "invalidParameter": {
                    "value": {
                      "errCode": 22010002,
                      "message": "Invalid parameter"
                    }
                  },
                  "userExists": {
                    "summary": "User exists, platformEndUserId required",
                    "value": {
                      "errCode": 22010101,
                      "message": "User already exists, platformEndUserId required for recharge"
                    }
                  },
                  "userNotFound": {
                    "value": {
                      "errCode": 22010102,
                      "message": "User not found with provided platformEndUserId"
                    }
                  },
                  "userMismatch": {
                    "value": {
                      "errCode": 22010103,
                      "message": "User information mismatch - IDs do not match"
                    }
                  },
                  "invalidCode": {
                    "value": {
                      "errCode": 22010031,
                      "message": "Invalid recharge code"
                    }
                  },
                  "brandMismatch": {
                    "value": {
                      "errCode": 22010049,
                      "message": "Brand mismatch - code brand does not match partner brand"
                    }
                  },
                  "codeExpired": {
                    "value": {
                      "errCode": 22010081,
                      "message": "Code expired"
                    }
                  },
                  "codeUsed": {
                    "value": {
                      "errCode": 22010091,
                      "message": "Code already used"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Authentication failed",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "errCode": 1010003,
                  "message": "Authentication failed"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Internal server error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "unexpectedException": {
                    "value": {
                      "errCode": 22010001,
                      "message": "Unexpected exception"
                    }
                  },
                  "rechargeFailed": {
                    "value": {
                      "errCode": 22010097,
                      "message": "Recharge failed"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/partner-api/boss/user/cancel-recharge/v1": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Account Management"
        ],
        "summary": "Cancel recharge",
        "description": "Cancel a previously applied recharge.\n\n## INACTIVE Account Behavior\n- Full reversal of recharge\n- Code returned to inventory\n- Code can be reused\n- `codeReturnedToInventory: true`\n\n## ACTIVE Account Behavior\n- Deduct time only (cannot reverse)\n- Code NOT returned to inventory\n- Code cannot be reused\n- `codeReturnedToInventory: false`\n",
        "operationId": "cancelRecharge",
        "security": [
          {
            "bearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CancellationRequest"
              },
              "example": {
                "requestId": "12345671130000140002",
                "partnerUserId": "user12345",
                "platformEndUserId": "d0em8df8lpi79uph6t60",
                "rechargeCode": "0024043040077815"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Cancellation successful",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CancellationResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "inactiveAccount": {
                    "summary": "INACTIVE Account Cancellation",
                    "description": "Full reversal with code returned to inventory",
                    "value": {
                      "errCode": 0,
                      "message": "Success",
                      "result": {
                        "cancellationSuccess": true,
                        "deductedPeriod": 30,
                        "remainingPeriod": 0,
                        "codeReturnedToInventory": true,
                        "accountStatus": "INACTIVE"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "activeAccount": {
                    "summary": "ACTIVE Account Cancellation",
                    "description": "Time deducted, code not returned",
                    "value": {
                      "errCode": 0,
                      "message": "Success",
                      "result": {
                        "cancellationSuccess": true,
                        "deductedPeriod": 30,
                        "remainingPeriod": 30,
                        "codeReturnedToInventory": false,
                        "accountStatus": "ACTIVE"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Bad request - Invalid parameters or business logic error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "invalidParameter": {
                    "value": {
                      "errCode": 22010002,
                      "message": "Invalid parameter"
                    }
                  },
                  "userNotFound": {
                    "value": {
                      "errCode": 22010102,
                      "message": "User not found"
                    }
                  },
                  "userMismatch": {
                    "value": {
                      "errCode": 22010103,
                      "message": "User information mismatch"
                    }
                  },
                  "noRechargeRecord": {
                    "value": {
                      "errCode": 22010104,
                      "message": "No recharge record found for this code"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Authentication failed",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "errCode": 1010003,
                  "message": "Authentication failed"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Internal server error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "errCode": 22010001,
                  "message": "Unexpected exception"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "basicAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "basic",
        "description": "HTTP Basic Authentication using clientId:clientSecret credentials.\nUsed for obtaining OAuth 2.0 access tokens.\n\nFormat: `Authorization: Basic <base64(clientId:clientSecret)>`\n"
      },
      "bearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "bearerFormat": "JWT",
        "description": "Bearer token authentication using OAuth 2.0 access token.\nToken valid for 86400 seconds (24 hours).\n\nFormat: `Authorization: Bearer <access_token>`\n"
      },
      "oauth2": {
        "type": "oauth2",
        "description": "OAuth 2.0 Client Credentials Grant",
        "flows": {
          "clientCredentials": {
            "tokenUrl": "/oauth2/token",
            "scopes": {}
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "TokenResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "access_token",
          "token_type",
          "expires_in"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "access_token": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "JWT access token for API authentication",
            "example": "eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..."
          },
          "token_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "Bearer"
            ],
            "description": "Token type (always \"Bearer\")",
            "example": "Bearer"
          },
          "expires_in": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Token validity duration in seconds (24 hours)",
            "example": 86400
          }
        }
      },
      "AccountRechargeRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "requestId",
          "partnerUserId",
          "rechargeCode"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "requestId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Unique transaction identifier for idempotency.\nUUID format recommended.\n",
            "example": "req-20231116-001"
          },
          "partnerUserId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Partner's user identifier",
            "example": "user12345"
          },
          "platformEndUserId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Platform-generated user ID.\n- Optional for account opening (will be generated)\n- Required for additional recharge\n",
            "example": "d0em8df8lpi79uph6t60"
          },
          "initialPassword": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Partner-generated password for account opening.\n- Required for account opening (without platformEndUserId)\n- Not required for additional recharge\n- Platform hashes with MD5 before storage\n- Never returned in API responses\n- Must be changed by end user on first login\n",
            "example": "Abc123xyz!"
          },
          "rechargeCode": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Recharge voucher code",
            "example": "0024043040077815"
          }
        }
      },
      "AccountRechargeResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "errCode",
          "message"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "errCode": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Error code (0 = success, non-zero = error).\nSee error codes section for details.\n",
            "example": 0
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Human-readable response message",
            "example": "Success"
          },
          "result": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "Response data (present only on success)",
            "required": [
              "platformEndUserId",
              "validityPeriod",
              "partnerUserId"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "platformEndUserId": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Platform-generated user ID.\nNewly generated for account opening, existing ID for recharge.\n",
                "example": "d0em8df8lpi79uph6t60"
              },
              "validityPeriod": {
                "type": "integer",
                "description": "Total subscription validity in days.\nFor account opening: initial period from code.\nFor recharge: updated total period.\n",
                "example": 30
              },
              "partnerUserId": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Partner's user identifier (echoed from request)",
                "example": "user12345"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "CancellationRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "requestId",
          "partnerUserId",
          "platformEndUserId",
          "rechargeCode"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "requestId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Unique transaction identifier for idempotency",
            "example": "req-20231116-003"
          },
          "partnerUserId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Partner's user identifier",
            "example": "user12345"
          },
          "platformEndUserId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Platform-generated user ID (required)",
            "example": "d0em8df8lpi79uph6t60"
          },
          "rechargeCode": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Recharge code to cancel",
            "example": "0024043040077815"
          }
        }
      },
      "CancellationResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "errCode",
          "message"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "errCode": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Error code (0 = success)",
            "example": 0
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Response message",
            "example": "Success"
          },
          "result": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "Cancellation result details",
            "required": [
              "cancellationSuccess",
              "deductedPeriod",
              "remainingPeriod",
              "codeReturnedToInventory",
              "accountStatus"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "cancellationSuccess": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "description": "Whether cancellation succeeded",
                "example": true
              },
              "deductedPeriod": {
                "type": "integer",
                "description": "Number of days deducted from account",
                "example": 30
              },
              "remainingPeriod": {
                "type": "integer",
                "description": "Number of days remaining after cancellation",
                "example": 30
              },
              "codeReturnedToInventory": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "description": "Whether the code was returned to inventory for reuse.\n- true: INACTIVE account (full reversal)\n- false: ACTIVE account (time deducted only)\n",
                "example": false
              },
              "accountStatus": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "ACTIVE",
                  "INACTIVE",
                  "CANCELLED"
                ],
                "description": "Current account status after cancellation",
                "example": "ACTIVE"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "errCode",
          "message"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "errCode": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Error code indicating the type of error.\n\nAuthentication Errors (1010xxx):\n- 1010001: Missing credentials\n- 1010003: Authentication failed\n\nBusiness Logic Errors (22010xxx):\n- 22010001: Unexpected exception\n- 22010002: Invalid parameter\n- 22010031: Invalid recharge code\n- 22010049: Brand mismatch\n- 22010081: Code expired\n- 22010091: Code already used\n- 22010097: Recharge failed\n- 22010101: User exists, platformEndUserId required\n- 22010102: User not found\n- 22010103: User information mismatch\n- 22010104: No recharge record found\n",
            "example": 22010002
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Human-readable error description",
            "example": "Invalid parameter"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
